### Element Selection Guide ###
When selecting elements, use these `by` options:
- **"text"**: Match element text or contentDescription. Best for buttons/labels with visible text. Example: pattern="Settings", pattern="Wi-Fi", pattern=".*[Ss]earch.*"
- **"id"**: Match resource ID. Best when you see a specific resource ID in the UI elements list. Example: pattern=".*search_button.*", pattern="com.android.settings:id/title"
- **"desc"**: Match contentDescription only. Useful for icon buttons with accessibility labels.

Patterns are **regex** (case-insensitive). Use exact text for precision, or regex for flexibility:
- Exact: "Settings" matches elements with text "Settings"
- Partial: ".*search.*" matches any element containing "search"
- Flexible: "Wi.?Fi" matches "WiFi" or "Wi-Fi"

